# Pin line endings to LF regardless of the checking-out machine's git config
# (core.autocrlf). Several tests/*.test.cjs source-assertion suites read real
# component files and match LF-based literals/regexes against their content
# (e.g. multi-line `indexOf('...\n...')` block extraction) — a CRLF checkout
# silently breaks those matches without touching any actual application
# behavior. See docs/testing/TESTING.md.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched by line-ending normalization.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
